{"id":"24d1c4528c1ab822","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-turing-degree.md","title":"Turing Degree","display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-turing-degree","aliases":["92-df-turing-degree"],"display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree","depends_on":["[[92-df-turing-jump]]","[[92-df-recursive-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-turing-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-turing-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51f43fedeac3bf1d\" href=\"?note=51f43fedeac3bf1d\" title=\"92-df-turing-jump\">92-df-turing-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A, B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A, B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Phi_e^B)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\Phi_e^B)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (fixed acceptable enumeration of unary partial <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-oracle-computable functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51f43fedeac3bf1d\" href=\"?note=51f43fedeac3bf1d\" title=\"92-df-turing-jump\">92-df-turing-jump</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (characteristic function of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T,\\equiv_T,\\deg_T\">\\(\\leq_T,\\equiv_T,\\deg_T\\)</span> (definition-target reducibility, equivalence, and degree)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\leq_T B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^B)=\\mathbb N\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\Phi_e^B(n)=\\chi_A(n))\\Bigr),\\\\\nA\\equiv_T B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(A\\leq_T B\\land B\\leq_T A),\\\\\n\\deg_T(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid A\\equiv_T B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\leq_T B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^B)=\\mathbb N\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\Phi_e^B(n)=\\chi_A(n))\\Bigr),\\\\\nA\\equiv_T B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(A\\leq_T B\\land B\\leq_T A),\\\\\n\\deg_T(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid A\\equiv_T B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Turing度：不可解性等级</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\equiv_T B\">\\(A \\equiv_T B\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>互相可计算</li>\n<li>Turing度是等价类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{0}\">\\(\\mathbf{0}\\)</span>：可计算集的度</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{0}&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf{0}&#39;\\)</span>：与无预言机跳跃编号相配准的停机集之度</li>\n<li>度结构<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{D}\">\\(\\mathcal{D}\\)</span>复杂</li>\n<li>与不完备性相关</li>\n<li>真算术的句子码集具有度<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 0^{(\\omega)}\">\\(\\mathbf 0^{(\\omega)}\\)</span>（有限跳跃的有效直和之度），而不是未说明的“某个高Turing度”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"51f43fedeac3bf1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-turing-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"51f43fedeac3bf1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\Phi_e^B)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (fixed acceptable enumeration of unary partial $B$-oracle-computable functions, see [[92-df-turing-jump]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$ (characteristic function of $A$, see [[92-df-recursive-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A, B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Phi_e^B)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T,\\equiv_T,\\deg_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\leq_T B&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^B)=\\mathbb N\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\Phi_e^B(n)=\\chi_A(n))\\Bigr),\\\\\nA\\equiv_T B&\\Longleftrightarrow(A\\leq_T B\\land B\\leq_T A),\\\\\n\\deg_T(A)&\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid A\\equiv_T B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A \\equiv_T B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{0}'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 0^{(\\omega)}","display":false}],"bytes":1486,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-strength.md]]\n[[92-df-consistent.md]]\n[[92-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[92-df-contradiction.md]]\n[[92-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[92-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[92-df-definability.md]]\n[[92-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[92-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[92-df-encoding-completeness.md]]\n[[92-df-enumerable.md]]\n[[92-df-expressible.md]]\n[[92-df-expression.md]]\n[[92-df-extension-theory.md]]\n[[92-df-feasible-mathematics.md]]\n[[92-df-final-count.md]]\n[[92-df-final-summary.md]]\n[[92-df-forcing.md]]\n[[92-df-formal-system.md]]\n[[92-df-formula-formation.md]]\n[[92-df-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-free-variable-function.md